       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you wrote it: amlodipine 30 mg by mouth once daily (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the dose is above the usual 10 mg/day maximum, that you confirmed it as intended, and that BP and HR need close monitoring. Pharmacy may still call you to verify it.\n\nBecause of the dose, you may want to order closer BP and HR monitoring, especially in the first hours after administration. You may also want hold parameters for hypotension."
